Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有什么可以捆绑你的双手 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There'll be no strings to bind your hands ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 除非我的爱不让你的心迷失 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Not if my love can't bind your heart ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 本来就没有必要再反对什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's no need to take a stand ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 早先我就不应该开始这一切 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ For it was I who chose to start ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果清晨预示了我们的罪恶 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If morning's echoes say we've sinned ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也许这就是我一直想要的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Well, it was what I wanted now ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我们是暗夜的受害者 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And if we're victims of the night ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将不会在光明里迷失 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I won't be blinded by the light ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我一声晨间天使 天使 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just call me angel of the morning angel ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在你离去时抚摸一下我的脸颊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just touch my cheek before you leave me, baby ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我一声晨间天使 天使 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just call me angel of the morning angel ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在你离去时抚摸一下我的脸颊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just touch my cheek before you leave me, baby ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我一声晨间天使 天使 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just call me angel of the morning angel ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在你离去时抚摸一下我的脸颊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just touch my cheek before you leave me, darling ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我一声晨间天使 天使 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just call me angel of the morning angel ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在你离去时抚摸一下我的脸颊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just touch my cheek before you leave me, darling ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:27.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（嗨 我是死侍）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:39.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惊悚赛格威之旅）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在后面好孤单啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda lonesome back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, little help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得握好方向盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, just, I have to keep my hands on the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫多芬德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Dopinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,侍 死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pool. Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（水仙 白日梦空气清新剂）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道不错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells good, no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说清新剂 说那妹子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Daffodil Daydream. The girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 吉塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. Gita.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她挺漂亮的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. She is quite lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来可能成为我称心的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have made me a very agreeable wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉塔的心被我表哥班都偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gita's heart has been stolen by my cousin Bandhu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这个人啊 又迷人 又不老实\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is as dishonorable as he is attractive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多芬德 我开始觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dopinder, I'm starting to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我上你这车 肯定是有理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a reason I'm in this cab today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 先生 我这车不是你叫的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sir, you called for it, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这位棕皮肤瘦身板朋友 爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my slender brown friend. Love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个非常美妙的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a beautiful thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见爱时 全世界都会飘着水仙花的香味\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find it, the whole world tastes like Daffodil Daydream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要把握爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gotta hold onto love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 紧紧把握 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- tight! - Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要重蹈我的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make the same mistakes I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白没？- 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然全世界的味道 闻着就像刚做完高温瑜珈的琼肥妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else the whole world tastes like Mama June after hot yoga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 琼肥妈是什么味道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what does Miss Mama June taste like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像俩流浪汉穿着灌满尿的鞋在滚床单 - 好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like two hobos fucking in a shoe filled with piss. - Okay, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说上一天 多芬德 重点是 这很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go all day, Dopinder. The point is, it's bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, it's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,死侍先生 你为什么要穿成这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, why the fancy red suit, Mr. Pool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天是圣诞节 多芬德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's because it's Christmas Day, Dopinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我在追我淘气榜单上一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm after someone on my naughty list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经等了一年零三周…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting one year, three weeks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,零六天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}six days and, oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,零14分钟 就为了让他 为他对我做过的事付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}14 minutes to make him fix what he did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你做过什么 死侍先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did he do to you, Mr. Pool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会让你失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't disappoint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd better not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个月的货运呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about next month's shipment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There won't be one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是只有你要打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one with a war to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们在供应上面有这么点小问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we've had this small disruption to our supply chain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就需要你有点耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd appreciate your patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个月我们会全数运来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deliver in full the following month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你做生意很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure doing business with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的弹药包给忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot my ammo bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要折回去吗？- 不用了 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we turn back? - No, no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it. I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,9 10 11 12颗子弹 要么完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}9, 10, 11, 12 bullets, or bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共27.5美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, $27.50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作时从不带钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I never carry a wallet when I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会破坏我这身战服的线条美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruins the lines of my suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 但是… 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. - But, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们爽快地击个掌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how about a crisp high five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也祝您四月周二快乐 死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a convivial Tuesday in April to you too, Pool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿耶 我今晚想咻咻咻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hey, yeah I wanna shoop, baby ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 咻 咻 呗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Shoop shooop ba-doop, shoop ba-doop ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 咻 咻 呗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Shoop ba-doop, ba-doop, ba-doop ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你拿着枪 身材匀称 尤其是背影 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You're packed and you're stacked 'specially in the back ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 兄弟 想谢谢你老妈给了你个翘臀 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Brother, wanna thank your mother for a butt like that ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 能让我摸一摸那摇摆的大波吗？ ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can I get some fries with that shake-shake boobie? ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要是眼神也能像枪一样杀死你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If looks could kill you would be an uzi ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你就是只小猎枪 砰 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You're a shotgun, bang! ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇… 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 我知道 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello. I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去跪舔谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose balls did I have to fondle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能拍到我的第一部专属电影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get my very own movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那人名字里确实有个「金刚」哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it does rhyme with "Polverine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下面那玩意儿可真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got a nice pair of smooth criminals down under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我还有事 去整一下脸 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I got places to be, a face to fix and, oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀的坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad guys to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老二暴击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cock shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奢华的真皮座椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich Corinthian leather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找弗朗西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Francis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟吼 哟吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yanky, yanky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我从没这么说过 但是别吞哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never said this, but don't swallow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是没关炉子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I leave the stove on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在播报突发新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, breaking news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晨于跨城高速上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A multi-car collision turned shots fired{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起多辆汽车相撞事故中出现多发枪击\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the crosstown expressway this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于交通堵塞 警察未能赶到现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gridlock has kept police from the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议市民避免出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Residents are advised to remain in their homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,持械攻击者非常危险 并身着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assailant appears to be armed, dangerous, and wearing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一套红衣 - 一套红衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a red suit. - A red suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑后 走 我们有任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negasonic! Come, we have mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢力士 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colossus, wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了死侍那么多机会 让他加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given Deadpool every chance to join us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他就跟个孩子似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he'd rather act like a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个全副武装的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A heavily-armed child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候才能成熟点 能看到成为X战警一员的好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will he grow up and see benefits of becoming X-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么好处？合身的紧身衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which benefits? The matching unitards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔几年就会爆炸的房子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house that blows up every few years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,历经磨难才能得到历练\N{\fnArial\fs30}House blowing up builds character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃过早饭了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ate breakfast, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,早饭是一天中最重要的一餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast is most important meal of day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 蛋白棒 对骨骼好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, protein bar. Good for bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,死侍说不定想打断你的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadpool may try to break yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能想知道 「为什么要穿红衣服？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be wondering, "Why the red suit?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这样坏人就看不出我流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's so bad guys can't see me bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位也有同样的想法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's got the right idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿的是红棕色的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wore the brown pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我只有12颗子弹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine! I only have 12 bullets…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们要共同享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're gonna have to share!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始倒数吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's count them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,十 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}10! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine. Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit-fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,差死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 好死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. Good Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人没数好哦 六\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's not counting. Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打到你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接打中菊花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right up main street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太蠢了 值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid! Worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要好好撸一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm touching myself tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit-biscuit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪啊 弗朗西斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you at, Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不是弗朗西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Francis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩儿真的？袖子都卷起来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Rolling up the sleeves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably thinking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我男朋友说过这是部超级英雄片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My boyfriend said this was a superhero movie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个穿红衣服的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that guy in the red suit just turned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接把另一个人做成肉串啦「\N{\fnArial\fs30}that other guy into a fucking kabab!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我可能很「超级」 但可不是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I may be super, but I'm no hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 没错 严格来说 这是谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, technically, this is a murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些特别美好的爱情故事 就是从谋杀开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some of the best love stories start with a murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就确确实实是一个爱情故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's exactly what this is, a love story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了说清楚点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to tell it right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带你回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take you back to long before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿这身红色弹力衣之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I squeezed this ass into red spandex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:25.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说慢点行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, would it help if I slow it down for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有叫披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't order the pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是红礁路7348号码？你是梅山特先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this 7348 Red Ledge Drive? Are you Mr. Merchant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可是我这位梅山特先生 没叫什么鬼披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the Mr. Merchant who didn't order the fucking pie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁叫的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who placed the call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,菠萝橄榄披萨是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pineapple and olive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜咸口味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet and salty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我家干什…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck you doing in my crib…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,外皮烤焦了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it burnt crust?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 但愿没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… God, I hope not. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 听我说 要是和那局扑克有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa… Man, look, if this is about that poker game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟豪威说过 我跟他说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Howie, I told him that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你想要什么都拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, look, just take whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你对他下手之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, before you do anything to him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意先给我点小费吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you mind if I get a big tip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫杰里米是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jeremy, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫韦德 韦德威尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm-hmm. Wade. Wade Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小费是不可能的 杰儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a no go on the tiperoo, Jer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来找他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 哇 差点儿就碰别人的枪头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wow, dodged a big-time bullet on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你还没完事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not out of the woods yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,少戴些花里胡哨的玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to seriously ease up on the bedazzling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上那是衣服 不是吊灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're jeans, not a chandelier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 钱包不还给你了 是你自己给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.S. I'm keeping your wallet. You did kinda give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那个 兄弟 能把山姆的会员卡还给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just look, man, can I have my Sam's card…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再唧歪老子毙了你的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot your fucking cat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这话是什么意思 我没养猫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know what that means. I don't have a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我刚刚拉屎的猫砂是谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then whose kitty litter did I just shit in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢 你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo, tell me something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况是披萨无法改善的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what situation isn't improved by pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是恰好认识梅根奥夫洛斯基？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you happen to know a Meghan Orflosky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吗？奥夫洛斯基？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting that right? Orflosky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥洛夫斯基？好 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Orlovsky? Good. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she knows you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰里米 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy, I belong to a group of guys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门拿钱帮人揍人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who take a dime to beat a fella down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而小梅根呢 她没什么钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And little Meghan, she's not made of money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她幸运得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}but lucky for her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a soft spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可我… - 跟踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I'm a… - A stalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐吓也会伤人的 杰儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threats hurt, Jer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也完全比不上锯齿刀伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though not nearly as badly as serrated steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以离梅根远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So keep away from Meghan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这事儿就结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 结了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. We are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就这么结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're totally done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看看自己那副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该做什么 我吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what to do. I was so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会心软的 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soft spot, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是再敢瞟她一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even look in her general direction again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会让你好好看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will learn in the worst of ways{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我硬起来是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have some hard spots too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这话有歧义吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That came out wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm… Meghan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:03.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（披萨 菲戈餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对不起）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杰里米留给你的最后的话 他说对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard the last of Jeremy. He's sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friggin' way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该把我的直排轮带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've brought my roller blades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那些小毛头看看该怎么滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show these kids how it's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是种回报哈 但主要还是要给钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And that's why we do it. But mostly the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你能去搞定我继父吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, think you could fuck up my step-dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄的人都是活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give a guy a pavement facial, it's because he's earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-no-no-no. That I ain't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 永远不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Never will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Fuck you, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个坏人 收钱去教训更坏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a bad guy who gets paid to fuck up worse guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到玛格丽特姐妹酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Sister Margaret's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就好像我这种雇佣兵的人才市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a job fair for mercenaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把我们看做混蛋牙仙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of us as really fucked up tooth fairies…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同的是 牙仙收集落牙 留下钱 而我们敲掉牙齿 拿走钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}except we knock out the teeth and take the cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷 你的名字不会出现在我们的金卡片上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd best hope we never see your name on a gold card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克 雷菲尔德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck! Liefeld…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Wade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:17:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德威尔逊 可怜人的守护圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade Wilson, patron saint of the pitiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要「吹箫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love a Blow Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐 我也想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是酒 紧身裤男 不过首先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drink, moose knuckle. But first…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杰里米盖瑞特）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我不会收人家的保姆钱 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, and I ain't taking any babysitting money, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得把这些钱还给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure that gets back to Ms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥洛夫斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orlovsky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个雇佣兵 你心肠还是很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a merc, you're pretty warm-blooded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你也没拿那男孩怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you let the kid off easy, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不是个坏孩子 鼹鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's not a bad kid, Weas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是稍稍跟踪了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little light stalking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他这个年纪 可比他坏多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was way worse than him when I was his age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过国外各种地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was traveling to exotic places…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴格达 摩加迪沙 杰克逊维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baghdad, Mogadishu, Jacksonville, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见各种新奇的人 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}meeting new and exciting people. And then, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们 是啊 我在你的Instagram上看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing them. Yeah, I've seen your Instagram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那特种部队到底在杰克逊维尔干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what was Special Forces doing in Jacksonville, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们那有家特别赞的星期五餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a wonderful TGI Fridays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咖啡酒 奶酒加…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Kahlua, Baileys and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}whipped cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一杯「吹箫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you a Blow Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要我做这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you make me make that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 凯莉 凯莉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, Kelly, Kelly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个送给巴克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that over to Buck please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他是布思请他的 是个小前戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell him it's from Boothe. Little foreplay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me what good will come of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要 我只是骚扰他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take the shits. I just disturb them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布思 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boothe! - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 淡定 兄弟 - 等等 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy, man. - Hold up! Hold up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 祝你健康 - 干你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheers. To your health. - Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你个混蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you fat fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是条新凳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a new stool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈别给老子起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the fuck down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 揍得屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Took his ass out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 让一让 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move. Move, move, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克 一边呆着去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck, go rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,布思被揍了 然后倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boothe got hit then went down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's still breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没有赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wins today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,手段不错啊 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真给你说准了 我押下一个死的是布思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me. I picked Boothe in the dead pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你押的谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you pick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 韦德 这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Wade, about that, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会押我死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not bet on me to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛格丽特姐妹酒吧死亡赌局）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你押我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet on me to die{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 真是世界上最糟糕的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker, you're the world's worst friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的美 我要活到102岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, joke's on you. I'm living to 102.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再死掉 像底特律一样「长寿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then dying. Like the city of Detroit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我只是… 我想赢钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just… I wanted to win money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没赢过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never win anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,管你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位幸运兵 今天酒我请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers of fortune, drinks on me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是国内的酒 没有进口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domestic, nothing imported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇… 哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你确定要倾情投入吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, are you sure you wanna shoot your whole wad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服很紧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瓦妮莎 - 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vanessa. - Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种女孩来这个地方来嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a nice place like you doing in a girl like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这妹子我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hit that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克 你最好道歉 省得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck, you best apologize before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 受这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快道歉 肥甘道夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the magic words, Fat Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 用鼻子呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Breathe through the nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑子管不好我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a filter between my brain and my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧 行了 嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go. Okay. Hey, oh, oh, oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放过他吧 他说过抱歉了 - 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hakuna his tatas. He's sorry. - I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧 快走 找个地儿施咒去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Go. Go cast a spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰这用来卖的身子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hands off the merchandise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来卖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merchandise? Huh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟人上床来挣钱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}bump fuzzies for money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 童年很不幸吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. - Rough childhood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你的不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rougher than yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出生前爸爸就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy left before I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈怀我前我爸就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy left before I was conceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.43,0:21:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有被烟头烫过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever had a cigarette put out on your skin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然烟头在哪灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else do you put one out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候被性侵过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was molested.{\r}
