Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国就有很多新的试验药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there were all these new experimental drugs from Germany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦妮莎已经开始采取各种计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanessa's already working on Plan A, B, all the way through Z.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢？我在记下她这张脸的所有细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I'm memorizing the details of her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我第一次见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it's the first time I'm seeing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.33,0:27:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.49,0:27:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.87,0:27:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢消化一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time to process this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急于做任何决定 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important not to do anything rash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是一个90公斤重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if I were a 200-pound sack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫弗朗西斯的混蛋 我会在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of assholes named Francis, where would I hide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.42,0:28:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众此刻安静了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hush falls over the crowd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.30,0:28:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为天才新人韦德W威尔逊上场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as rookie sensation Wade W. Wilson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.72,0:28:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来自加拿大萨斯喀彻温省里贾纳市 准备好要开动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of Regina, Saskatchewan, lines up the shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的姿势不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}His form looks good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.77,0:28:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以里贾纳和「有意思」很押韵嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why Regina rhymes with fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.15,0:28:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 你们所看到的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, what you're witnessing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.56,0:28:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是一场痛快的复仇赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}is sweet dick-kicking revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.82,0:29:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,狠狠来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Giving him the business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.74,0:29:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种行为太缺乏运动员精神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is taking unsportsmanlike conduct to a whole new level!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去不错啊 弗朗西斯 休息得挺好哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good, Francis. Well rested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你被爆菊爆得挺多的呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you've been pitching, not catching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我不？不记得啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ringing any bells? No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.18,0:29:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.43,0:29:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德他妈的威尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade fucking Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.10,0:29:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也跟蜘蛛侠一样呢 不过我是被沙皮狗咬了一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like I got bit by a radioactive Shar-Pei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.48,0:29:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怪谁呢 弗朗西斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And whose fault is that, huh, Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候该跟你就我这张丑爆的脸 好好算算账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, time to undo what you did to this butterface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你该谢谢我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you should thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.53,0:29:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是我造就了你永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, I made you immortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.11,0:29:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实还挺嫉妒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually quite jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 不过这种生活可不快活 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but this ain't a life worth living, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要像90年代末软饼干乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm about to do to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟蹋音乐那么糟蹋你\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Limp Bizkit did to music in the late 90s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都同意很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can all agree that shit just went sideways{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不受控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most colossal way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.51,0:30:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许还不是最糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe not the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.97,0:30:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最宝贝的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… This is my most prized possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.31,0:30:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,威猛乐队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.39,0:30:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 是威猛乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Wham!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.73,0:30:23.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,《飞黄腾达》这张专辑 是乔治和安迪的巅峰之作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make It Big is the album that George and Andy earned the exclamation point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, am I supposed to just smile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.90,0:30:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑着请你出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wave you out the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当做是春季大扫除嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it like spring cleaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.74,0:30:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过春天可能就等于死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if spring was death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我这五分硬币的数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, if I had a nickel for every time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.66,0:30:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和对着伯娜黛特皮特丝撸的次数差不多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spanked it to Bernadette Peters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是这么回事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯娜黛特哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernadette is not going anywhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.59,0:30:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 癌症也只在我的肝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Cancer is only in my liver, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.05,0:30:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肺里 前列腺里 脑子里嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}lungs, prostate, and brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.42,0:30:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了这些我肯定还能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All things I can live without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.93,0:30:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要呆在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong here at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.97,0:30:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在你的战神金刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by your Voltron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伯娜黛特和你的我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your Bernadette, and your me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.93,0:30:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你我都知道癌症就相当于完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we both know that cancer is a shit-show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.11,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋到极点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, a Yakov-Smirnoff-opening-for-the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋到不能更完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin-Doctors-at-the-lowa-State-Fair shit-show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能让你卷进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And under no circumstances will I take you to that show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to remember me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.16,0:31:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一个憔悴不堪的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the ghost of Christmas me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.08,0:31:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想记住我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wanna remember us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 下辈子我还会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I will find you in the next life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.00,0:31:26.09,Title,0,0,0,0,,我要在你的窗外 用手提音响放《无心快语》\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna boom-box Careless Whisper outside your window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.17,0:31:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,威猛乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wham!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.01,0:31:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯什么放歌行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is boom-boxing shit. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.64,0:31:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会战胜癌症的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can fight this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.19,0:31:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我刚刚意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I just realized something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.19,0:31:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 你的生命比我的要糟糕多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win. Your life is officially way more fucked up than mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.70,0:31:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.38,0:32:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.72,0:32:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼹鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像需要来杯「吹箫」 再去洗个澡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you need a Blow Job and a shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.55,0:32:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼貌起见 还是应该先洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though courtesy calls for the latter first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来三杯帕特龙龙舌兰吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about three shots of Patron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.47,0:32:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然来一把小麦草？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how about Triticum aestivum, wheatgrass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.23,0:32:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对免疫系统好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent for the immune system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.69,0:32:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你这话听着就像瓦妮莎说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ. You sound like Vanessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喏 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.02,0:32:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她预约了这么多 花花绿绿的医疗小册子上的诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sending away for all these colorful clinic brochures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.53,0:32:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定全是通过食品和药物管理局审核的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they're all FDA approved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,车臣 去那难道不是更容易得癌症吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chechnya. Isn't that where you go to get cancer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有中国 墨西哥中部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got China and Central Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.91,0:32:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他们怎么用西班牙语说「癌症」吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they say "cancer" in Spanish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.25,0:32:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来能猜出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have guessed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这张照片上你多开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how happy you look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意给我留着吗？把它挂起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I keep this? Put it up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.09,0:32:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就能记得你生龙活虎时的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can remember when you looked alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.01,0:32:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码死亡赌局我要赢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least now I'm gonna win the dead pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.01,0:32:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你要悲惨地死于癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you're gonna die tragically of cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.72,0:32:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 鼹鼠 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, Weas. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的那人是来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, that guy over there came in looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.73,0:33:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名片还真有死神的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real Grim Reaper type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.69,0:33:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 兴许能帮你活着演完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Might further the plot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.74,0:33:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boothe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.75,0:33:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了帮你诱拐儿童到货车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides luring children into a panel van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.71,0:33:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你最近被诊断出癌症晚期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you've recently been diagnosed with terminal cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.42,0:33:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你调查我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalker alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的职责 负责招人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job. Recruitment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾你现在过得很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you've had such a tough go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.05,0:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是名战士 属于特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're a fighter. Special Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.39,0:33:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,服役期间杀死41人\N{\fnArial\fs30}41 confirmed kills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.27,0:33:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,每七周杀一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One every seven weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.73,0:33:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人家理发的频率一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same rate most folks get a haircut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了能缓冲杀人的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's to wash the taste out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.11,0:33:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要忘记杀人的滋味可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tough to forget being so impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.57,0:33:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今你致力于\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you spend your days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.61,0:33:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助那些可怜人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}sticking up for the little people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,人也会变 你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}People change. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.61,0:34:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表一个组织而来 我们或许能帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I represent an organization that may be able to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.62,0:34:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是告诉你我们可以治愈你的癌症呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you we can cure your cancer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还能赋予你 大多数人都梦寐以求的能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's more, give you abilities most men only dream of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.67,0:34:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你有点像电视上卖广告的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that you sound like an infomercial, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.59,0:34:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但卖的不是什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not a good one, like Slap Chop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,像震动摇摆哑铃那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}More Shake Weight-y.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界需要非凡的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world needs extraordinary soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不但能让你变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't just make you better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.68,0:34:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且能让你比更好还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make you better than better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.69,0:34:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一个超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}A superhero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.32,0:34:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 史密斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Agent Smith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.19,0:34:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄这档子事我做过 可没留下什么好底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried the hero business and it left a mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.78,0:34:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要是最后改主意了 我会联系你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I ever hit "fuck it", I'll look you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.83,0:34:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 这附近就有一所学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. We're within 500 yards of a school, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你走的时候得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you may wanna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝的自己付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His drink's on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.55,0:34:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.91,0:35:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.50,0:35:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做噩梦梦到连姆尼森了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a Liam Neeson nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.37,0:35:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我梦到自己绑架了他女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamt I kidnapped his daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.92,0:35:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he just wasn't having it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:44.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,嘿 《飓风营救》拍了三部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, they've made three of those movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.43,0:35:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看电影时 会让人不得不想 他到底是不是个好父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}At some point you have to wonder if he's just a bad parent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.03,0:36:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,癌症最可怕的 不是它对你的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst part about cancer isn't what it does to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.04,0:36:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是它对你爱的人造成的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what it does to the people you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.21,0:36:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道那人能不能救我的命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knew if this guy could save my life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.79,0:36:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却清楚 要救她 只有这一种办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I knew there was only one way that I could save hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.63,0:36:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级英雄不就是这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what superheroes do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.27,0:36:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞 我们来列一个 当超级英雄好处和坏处的单子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's pro-con this superhero thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.24,0:36:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好处 一大帮辣妹恨不得让你扑倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pro: They pull down a gaggle of ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.24,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能享受当地干洗折扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local dry cleaning discounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.66,0:36:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拍电影赚大钱 不管是原创个人故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucrative film deals, both origin stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.49,0:36:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是组队打怪电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}and larger ensemble team movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.74,0:36:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏处 他们都是可怜的听话乖宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Con: They're all lame-ass teacher's pets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我能听到你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.67,0:36:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是在跟你说 我在跟观众说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking to you. I was talking to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在这别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.00,0:37:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到过警告 死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been warned before, Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么用你的能力 显得十分鲁莽 可耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a shameful and reckless use of your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.01,0:37:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩我们都要押回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will both be coming with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.18,0:37:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 钢巨人 我现在没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Colossus, I don't have time for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你扯什么正义不正义 该不该做\N{\fnArial\fs30}the goody two-shoes bullshit right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.27,0:37:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.69,0:37:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑后少年弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negasonic Teenage Warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑后少年… 什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negasonic Teenage… What the shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.11,0:37:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是我听过最炫酷的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the coolest name ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.36,0:37:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是他的副手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're like, uh, his sidekick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是受训人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Trainee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.62,0:37:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.12,0:37:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,X战警把你留下来干嘛？做这种烦心事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-Men left you behind on what? Shit detail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.66,0:37:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that make you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装你不在这啊 黑后少年弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending you're not here, Negasonic Teenage Warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.29,0:37:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能换个名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we trade names?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.63,0:37:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.21,0:37:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呀 我还是个少女呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! I'm a teenage girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.67,0:37:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪也不来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather be anywhere than here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.88,0:37:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不开心啦 不说话啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all about long sullen silences…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要发脾气骂人啦 然后又要不作声啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed by mean comments, followed by more silences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.05,0:37:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你到底会怎么做呢？是生闷气不作声呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it gonna be, huh? Long sullen silence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.35,0:37:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是发脾气骂人？说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or mean comment? Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.23,0:37:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me in a box here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不允许这种行为 死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't allow this, Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 安安静静地跟我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.07,0:38:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个大蠢驴铁块\N{\fnArial\fs30}You big chrome cock-gobbler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说可不够友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.49,0:38:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要坏我的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really gonna fuck this up for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.32,0:38:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 那个傻逼他活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, that wheezing bag of dick-tips has it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.74,0:38:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个十足的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pure evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.71,0:38:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且… 也没人受伤啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides… Nobody's getting hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到这的时候他就已经在那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was already up there when I got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.55,0:38:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德 你不至于这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade, you are better than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加入我们吧 用你的能力去做好事 - 抬头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Join us. Use your powers for good. - Heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a superhero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.72,0:38:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.77,0:38:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我决定要成为打击犯罪的恶棍的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day I decide to become a crime-fighting shit-swizzler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.23,0:38:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定和另一帮怨声载道的人 在梦幻庄园做室友时\N{\fnArial\fs30}who rooms with a bunch of other little whiners at the Neverland mansion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.61,0:38:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,庄园的主人还是个又老又丑的秃头\N{\fnArial\fs30}of some creepy, old, bald, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.26,0:38:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得就像信了邪教似的一个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven's Gate-looking motherfucker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.57,0:38:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}on that day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.40,0:38:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会发送给你一个 闪闪发光 快乐的好友请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send your shiny, happy ass a friend request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.61,0:38:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前 我要把我来这的目的完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then, I'mma do what I came here to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让我做 我就一巴掌呼死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either that or slap the bitch outta you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦德 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wade… - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.29,0:38:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 小平头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip it, Sinéad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:38:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 死傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, douche-pool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.58,0:38:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你在看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hope you're watching…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.63,0:39:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.80,0:39:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.81,0:39:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canada!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.15,0:39:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,击裆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cock shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.27,0:39:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老婆真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your poor wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.07,0:39:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该住手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.45,0:39:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙都怕霸王龙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the dinosaurs feared the T. rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证有你好看的 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise this gets worse for you, big boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过一条腿也能打架的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hear of the one-legged man in the ass-kicking contest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.01,0:39:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有开关能关上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have off switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.51,0:39:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊 就在前列腺旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's right next to the prostate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.26,0:39:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是打开的开关哦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is that the on switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.43,0:39:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.02,0:40:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去和X教授谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us go talk to the Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.36,0:40:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡沃伊演的还是斯图尔特演的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}McAvoy or Stewart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.19,0:40:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间线真是混乱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These timelines are so confusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不管是生是死 你都要跟我走」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dead or alive, you're coming with me!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会恢复的 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will recover, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.33,0:40:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都能自我恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.46,0:40:24.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,看过《127小时》吗？剧透提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see 127 Hours? Spoiler alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.63,0:40:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.84,0:40:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.01,0:40:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可是卖点啊 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's the money shot, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are You There God? It's Me, Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.53,0:40:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能更倒霉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock, meet bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.40,0:40:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当生活极其不如意时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when life ends up breathtakingly fucked…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以回想下某个重大的 糟糕的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can generally trace it back to one big, bad decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.00,0:41:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个一路把你带到谷底的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that sent you down the road to Shitsburgh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.21,0:41:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个？这就是我的那个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}This? Well, this was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最让我暖心的事 就是别人改变心意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing warms my heart more than a change of someone else's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finally hit "fuck it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.10,0:41:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你要对得起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise you'll do right by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才对得起另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can do right by someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.89,0:41:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.73,0:41:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把战服做成绿色的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please don't make the super-suit green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.77,0:41:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面也不要有动画啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or animated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.78,0:41:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,移过去 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地儿还真是卫生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place seems sanitary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.42,0:41:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第一个要求就是抬我的人手要暖点\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first request is warmer hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我的天 手术台也要暖点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And, Jesus, a warmer table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.97,0:42:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真该想个安全暗号 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should really come up with a safe word, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.26,0:42:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想「猪肉和豆子」怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking "pork and beans."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.61,0:42:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身为一个女的 劲儿也太大了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a little strong for a lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.61,0:42:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定长了小弟弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling wang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.95,0:42:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,叼根火柴干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with the matches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.45,0:42:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,修整牙齿的？还是模仿史泰龙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oral fixation or just a big Stallone fan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.66,0:42:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点 安琪尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, Angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.67,0:42:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来铺床的还是干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here for the turndown service, or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.17,0:42:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来一个话多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have another talker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.34,0:42:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一天加入超级英雄阵营太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just excited about my first day at superhero camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.34,0:42:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.80,0:42:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生 我叫阿贾克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson, my name's Ajax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.81,0:42:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个工作坊是我开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I manage this workshop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.98,0:42:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去的欢迎词中全是婉言 比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my welcome speech used to be full of euphemisms like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.31,0:42:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「可能会有一点点痛」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This may hurt a little."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.82,0:42:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你可能会感到一点点不适」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This may cause you some discomfort."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.94,0:42:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我现在诚实多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've grown blunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:42:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个工作坊的项目不是由政府牵头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This workshop is not a government-led program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.99,0:43:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个私人机构 专门把你这样的回收物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a private institution that turns reclamation projects like yourself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.66,0:43:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成具有超能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}into men of extraordinary abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.66,0:43:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要是以为超能力 可以不付代价就获得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you think super-human powers are acquired painlessly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.84,0:43:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.34,0:43:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在给你注射一种血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm injecting you with a serum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.88,0:43:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以激活你的DNA中潜在的突变基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}that activates any mutant genes lurking in your DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.67,0:43:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让其有效 我们需要让你承受极端的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it to work we need to subject you to extreme stress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.02,0:43:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听说过「要做蛋卷 先打碎蛋」吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard that whole "make an omelet, break some eggs" bit, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.06,0:43:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你很痛的 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to hurt you, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.69,0:43:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经也是这里的一名病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a patient here once myself, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.74,0:43:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗对于每个人的效果都不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treatment affects everyone differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.57,0:43:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪尔因此变得超乎常人得强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made Angel inhumanly strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.74,0:43:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于我 我的反射能力得以提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my case, it enhanced my reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.25,0:43:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也烧焦了我的神经末梢 让我感觉不到疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also scorched my nerve endings, so I no longer feel pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.92,0:43:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我什么也感觉不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, in fact, I no longer feel anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.26,0:44:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 多谢 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks! Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.39,0:44:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你牙齿里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something in your teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.06,0:44:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在正中间 我没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in the middle there. Just, I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.27,0:44:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是片生菜还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little nugget of romaine lettuce or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.23,0:44:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着闹心了好一会儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been bothering me for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.07,0:44:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗到你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, made you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.41,0:44:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 阿贾克斯是你的真名吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is Ajax your actual name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.12,0:44:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去像是你编出来的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it sounds suspiciously made up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.91,0:44:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真名叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.08,0:44:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文？布鲁斯？斯科特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? Bruce? Scott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.41,0:44:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇？里克斯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch? The Rickster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.79,0:44:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是巴西弗尔蒂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it Basil Fawlty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑话真够多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, joke away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.59,0:44:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽默感在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing that never survives this place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.96,0:44:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就留不长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a sense of humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.96,0:44:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.22,0:44:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.97,0:44:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.59,0:44:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.30,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna leave me all alone here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和火气没那么大的罗茜欧唐内单独共处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with less-angry Rosie O'Donnell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.81,0:44:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it's going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.94,0:44:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾上腺素是这种血清的催化剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adrenaline acts as a catalyst for the serum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.61,0:45:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要你不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're going to have to make you suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.82,0:45:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走运的话 突变基因会被激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're lucky, the mutant genes will activate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并以非常壮观的方式表达出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and manifest in a spectacular fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.96,0:45:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不幸 我们就得继续折磨你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, well, we'll have to keep on hurting you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.63,0:45:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,用新的 不同的方法折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}in new and different ways, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.96,0:45:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个都更令人痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}each more painful than the last…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.01,0:45:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最后你发生突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you finally mutate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.97,0:45:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说人生清单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean a bucket list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.69,0:45:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还狗生清单呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a fuck-it list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.02,0:45:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用奥运火炬点根烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd really like to light a spliff off the Olympic torch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.32,0:45:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后给我来一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass it to me right after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.20,0:45:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了和WNBA萨克拉门托君主队队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not forget naked tandem base-jumping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,双人裸体定点跳伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the WNBA's Sacramento Monarchs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.20,0:45:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的清单里肯定有在公共场合裸露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on my bucket list would involve public nudity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.83,0:45:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后把梅雷迪斯巴克斯特闷在被子里 闻一闻我在里面放的屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, giving Meredith Baxter-Birney a Dutch oven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.00,0:46:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 闻梅雷迪斯巴克斯特的屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Receiving a Dutch oven from Meredith Baxter-Birney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.84,0:46:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的孩子们做香蕉烙饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making banana pancakes for my kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.68,0:46:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦妮莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见瓦妮莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see Vanessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.69,0:46:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真可爱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.07,0:46:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然不知道你说的是谁 但我很感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about anyone else, but I'm touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.53,0:46:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.61,0:46:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.07,0:46:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鼓励你们分散注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I encourage distractions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.54,0:46:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你们就这么放弃 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want you giving up on us, now would we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.91,0:46:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别他妈任他摆弄 坎宁安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't take any shit from him, Cunningham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能有多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}How tough can he be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.21,0:46:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭他叫弗朗西斯这种名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a name like Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.09,0:46:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他合法登记的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his legal name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.09,0:46:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「阿贾克斯」 这名字是他借鉴洗洁精来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got "Ajax" from the dish soap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.60,0:46:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,F-R-A-N-C-I…\N{\fnArial\fs30}F-R-A-N-C-I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.77,0:46:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.90,0:47:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你的白大褂上 顺下来这个干洗的名字牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snagged the dry cleaning tag off your lab coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:04.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗里曼 弗朗西斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.61,0:47:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一说 说不定 我能给你个超级英雄的折扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}FYI, I could probably get you the superhero discount.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.11,0:47:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是无休止地讨人嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so relentlessly annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.57,0:47:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.66,0:47:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我还没听过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.95,0:47:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行行好闭上你那张臭嘴行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you do us all a favor and shut the fuck up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.24,0:47:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就把你的嘴封上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll sew your pretty mouth shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.08,0:47:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你就不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.79,0:47:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种没个头的折磨有个问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, here's the problem with round-the-clock torture…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.13,0:47:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法真正地加强程度或提高频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you can't really step it up from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这么认为的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.31,0:47:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这还不能激活你突变 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this doesn't unlock your mutation, then, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.64,0:47:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没什么能激活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.44,0:47:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what we're going to do is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.65,0:47:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,降低空气中的氧气浓度\N{\fnArial\fs30}lower the oxygen concentration in the air…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.44,0:47:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你感觉将要窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the exact point you feel like you're suffocating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.32,0:47:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的脑电波慢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your brainwaves slow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.65,0:47:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是意味着你即将失去知觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning you're about to pass out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.16,0:47:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会补充氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll turn up the O2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.32,0:47:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你心率降低\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your heart rate slows…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你喘得过来气\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning you're able to catch your breath…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.62,0:47:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会停止氧气供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll turn it back down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.62,0:48:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在那经受这些吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where we'll leave you. Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.63,0:48:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以前一定是大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I thought you guys were dicks before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.96,0:48:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道最有意思的是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the funniest part of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.13,0:48:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为我们在把你变成超级英雄呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think we're making you a superhero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.34,0:48:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 一个可耻的退伍兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. A dishonorable discharge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.51,0:48:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道和妓女鬼混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hip-deep in hookers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.85,0:48:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你个小秘密吧 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little secret, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个工作坊不制造超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}This workshop doesn't make superheroes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.15,0:48:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造的是超级奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}we make super-slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.36,0:48:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你定制一个控制颈圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fit you with a control collar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.15,0:48:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你卖给出价最高的客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}and auction you off to the highest bidder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.87,0:48:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们会让你做什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what they'll have you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐吓平民 虐杀为自由而战的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorizing citizens, putting down freedom fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.71,0:48:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定只是偶尔让你割割草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just mow the occasional lawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.04,0:48:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈有什么毛病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.84,0:48:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历过这些 你不可能回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never going home after this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你这张英勇的面庞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's a brave face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.89,0:49:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait! Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.85,0:49:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你的牙齿上真的有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you actually have something in your teeth now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.69,0:49:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.40,0:49:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「周末」 ？说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Weekend"? Back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.20,0:49:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weekend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.07,0:49:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过这是个爱情故事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say this was a love story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.24,0:49:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实是部惊悚片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a horror movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.13,0:50:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人当不上返校舞会的国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like someone lost his shot at Homecoming King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.64,0:50:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.81,0:50:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是增加了你的压力值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've merely raised your stress levels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.27,0:50:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好触发你发生突变啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}high enough to trigger a mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.15,0:50:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋虐待狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sadistic fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.98,0:50:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我治好了你的癌症 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've cured you, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.32,0:50:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今你的变异细胞什么都能治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your mutated cells can heal anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们正在攻击你的癌细胞 和形成的速度一样快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's attacking your cancer as fast as it can form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.12,0:50:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前也见过类似的副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've seen similar side-effects before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.99,0:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could cure them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.62,0:50:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不就没意思了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where's the fun in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.63,0:50:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再次把你关起来 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna shut you in again, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.97,0:50:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是出于需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because I need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.85,0:51:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是因为我想这么玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.03,0:51:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.53,0:51:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.83,0:51:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻着就像便便一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you smell like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.87,0:51:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.83,0:51:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 淡定 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. It's all right, it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.84,0:51:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们欠他的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we owe him that one, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.84,0:51:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take off. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.01,0:51:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.35,0:51:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.23,0:51:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.03,0:52:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你不会回答了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 弗朗西斯 我的嘴唇被封起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Francis. My lips are sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.92,0:52:44.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（氧气）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:57.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（氧气 冷冻 液体）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.49,0:54:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.86,0:54:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我能治好你这张丑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who can fix your ugly mug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.92,0:55:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.60,0:55:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.12,0:56:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅被治好了癌症…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't just get the cure to el cancer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且什么都能被治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the cure to el everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.01,0:56:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有一件事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was only one thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.30,0:56:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}that really mattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.38,0:57:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.84,0:57:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 一定很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that must hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.51,0:57:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.90,0:57:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 一脸瘤啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, he's so fucking gnarly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看他脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天呐 他好可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Poor guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.07,0:57:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别盯着人家看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, don't stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.24,0:57:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.76,0:58:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能让她的生活和我的一样丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. I'm not making her life as ugly as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.39,0:58:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 韦德 不会那么糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Wade, it can't be that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.02,0:58:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.40,0:58:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从内到外都是个怪物 我就该去个该死的马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a monster inside and out. I belong in a fucking circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.69,0:58:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德 瓦妮莎爱你 她不会在乎你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade, Vanessa loves you. She doesn't care what you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.03,0:58:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢你眼前的这副样子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like what you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.24,0:58:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.91,0:58:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像一只鳄梨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like an avocado{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.45,0:58:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,和另一只更老更丑的鳄梨生下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}had sex with an older, more disgusting avocado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.24,0:58:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.08,0:58:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还没好好传宗接代 像是被强暴后生下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gently. Like it was hate-fucking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.25,0:58:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两只鳄梨关系出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something wrong with the relationship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.12,0:58:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸是他们唯一不用暴力解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that was the only catharsis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而排出来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they could find without violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.92,0:58:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能治好这张丑脸的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only guy who can fix this fugly mug…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.42,0:58:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个突变工厂的英国恶搞老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the British shitstick who ran the mutant factory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.26,0:58:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑了 嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's gone. Poof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得做些什么来补救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well you gotta do something to remedy this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.93,0:58:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为照现在来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}because as of now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.10,0:58:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这张脸只有一种办法可以挽救\N{\fnArial\fs30}you only have one course of action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.97,0:58:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.27,0:58:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到弗朗西斯 - 演惊悚片\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find Francis. - Star in horror films.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.27,0:58:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍你自己的惊悚片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star in your own horror films.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.31,0:58:49.73,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看上去就像《猛鬼街》里弗莱迪克鲁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you look like Freddy Krueger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.81,0:58:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上了一张犹他州的地形图\N{\fnArial\fs30}face-fucked a topographical map of Utah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.11,0:58:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I'm actually gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.94,0:58:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他手下的人 从下弄到上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna work through his crew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.11,0:58:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到掏出弗朗西斯的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}until somebody gives up Francis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.61,0:58:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他修好我的脸 然后一枪毙了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}force him to fix this, then put a bullet in his skull…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.12,0:59:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后冲着他脑袋上的洞来一炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fuck the brain hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.78,0:59:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这画面真让我不敢想更不敢看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see that or think of it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.91,0:59:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那个混蛋是以为你死了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the douchebag does thinks you're dead, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.71,0:59:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.17,0:59:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你就一直让他以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. You should keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.83,0:59:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 戴副面具什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like, wear a mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.63,0:59:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一副非常厚的面具 一直戴着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. A very thick mask. All the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.13,0:59:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.30,0:59:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这张脸太难忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are haunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.97,0:59:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face is the stuff of nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.97,0:59:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是长了牙齿的蛋蛋是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a testicle with teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.35,0:59:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到死都娶不到妹子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you could die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.35,0:59:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此 这是为大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideally, for others' sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.48,0:59:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.98,0:59:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在需要一身战服和一个外号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need now is a suit and a nickname…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.81,0:59:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如韦德「逗你玩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Wade the Wisecracker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.15,0:59:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者恐怖恶魔 不死先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Scaredevil, Mr. Neverdie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.82,0:59:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.66,0:59:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.66,0:59:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把钱都押在你身上了 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put all my money on you and now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.66,0:59:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚才想到 我是不可能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just realized I'm never gonna win the, uh…{\r}
