Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.51,1:00:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,死侍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.68,1:00:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去好卖座的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a fucking franchise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.69,1:00:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去好好折磨折磨人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit's gonna have nuts in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.36,1:00:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.88,1:00:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.89,1:00:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏打水加柠檬 去血渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seltzer water and lemon for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.22,1:00:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接穿红的不就行了 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or wear red. Dumbass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.79,1:01:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我再问一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me ask twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.62,1:01:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.08,1:01:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.75,1:01:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我问了两遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me ask twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这面具是不是隔音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the mask muffling my voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.30,1:01:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.43,1:01:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯他妈的在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck is Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.94,1:01:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被磨冰机给碾死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to be killed by a Zamboni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.32,1:01:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.95,1:01:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.78,1:01:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐 我好抱歉哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! I'm so sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.79,1:01:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小蜘蛛猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! You little spider monkey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.46,1:02:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯… 在… 哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where… is… Francis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.13,1:02:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好纠结啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is confusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.34,1:02:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打你是不是性别歧视啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it sexist to hit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不打你会不会是更严重的性别歧视？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it more sexist to not hit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.34,1:02:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其中的界限真是… 模糊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the line gets real… blurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.81,1:02:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}WHERE IS FRANCIS?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你那个该死的老板在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where your fucking boss is{\r}
