Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.75,1:02:24.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（史密斯特工）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.16,1:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我别犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hesitate to call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.55,1:02:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, Jared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.89,1:02:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要个12寸的三明治…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the footlong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.68,1:02:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加满料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.36,1:03:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,服役期间杀死41人\N{\fnArial\fs30}41 confirmed kills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.03,1:03:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是89条人命了 马上就到90了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's 89. About to be 90.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.20,1:03:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wilson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.37,1:03:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮… 叮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding-ding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.20,1:03:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去真是生龙活虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking very alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.58,1:03:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有外在活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! Only on the outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.92,1:03:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会有善终的 是吗？- 你不会有善终 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not going to end well for me, is it? - This is not gonna end well for you, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.88,1:03:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your boss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.09,1:03:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能确切地告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you exactly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.42,1:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我 不过首先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll tell me. But first…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.89,1:03:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会想看这个画面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna look away for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.22,1:03:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这几只小猪仔要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this little piggy went to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.60,1:03:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了 史密斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Agent Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.07,1:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧 今天是个坐车的好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop in! Great day for a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.24,1:03:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后是怎么回事我们都清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we all know how this turned out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.57,1:03:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀 不该给你们看到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops! You weren't meant to see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.75,1:04:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这 都接上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. All caught up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.59,1:04:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉把血都流到你的垃圾里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about bleeding in all your garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.77,1:04:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用苏打水和柠檬去血渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seltzer water and lemon for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.94,1:04:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些怒火是控制不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kinds of anger can't be managed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.61,1:04:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 你花了那么久找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the kind where your year-long plan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.78,1:04:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果自己的手却被割断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ends with the wrong guy getting dismembered!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.29,1:04:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 要疗伤的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That said, when it comes time to licking wounds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.16,1:04:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里才是不二之选\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no place like home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.46,1:04:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的室友你们也见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, and I share that home with someone you've met, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.63,1:04:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是干洗店那位看不见的老太太 阿尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}the old blind lady from the laundromat, Al.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.30,1:04:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天呐 我真想抽可卡因\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I miss cocaine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.17,1:04:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.34,1:04:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,角色表演里跳出角色表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourth-wall break inside a fourth-wall break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.14,1:04:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是天下无敌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like 16 walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.31,1:04:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠的话 她就是罗宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's like Robin to my Batman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.85,1:05:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了她又老又黑又瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}except she's old, and black, and blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.81,1:05:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她爱上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think she's in love with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.81,1:05:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 罗宾肯定也爱蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, pretty sure Robin loves Batman, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.20,1:05:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.66,1:05:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 老懒虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sleepyhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.50,1:05:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里闻着就像是老太太的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like old lady pants in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.71,1:05:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是老了 我也穿着裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm old. I wear pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是淑女\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're no lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.55,1:05:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! So comfy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.88,1:05:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎了眼的一个好处 我从没见过你穿洞洞鞋的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upside of being blind: I've never seen you in Crocs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.01,1:05:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是我那双 撸的时候专门穿的大橡胶鞋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean my big, rubber masturbating shoes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.39,1:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.02,1:05:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎了的坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downside of being blind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.73,1:05:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这间小破屋里我什么都能听清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear everything in this duplex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.23,1:05:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit on a stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.48,1:05:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗生软膏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bactin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.57,1:05:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 抗生软膏就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Bactin should do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.86,1:05:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个库伦柜是怎么来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that Kullen coming along?{\r}
