Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.70,1:06:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 我倒是不讨厌库伦柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me. I don't mind the Kullen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.70,1:06:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是对赫达尔柜的改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an improvement on the Hurdal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.25,1:06:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 什么都是对赫达尔柜的改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Anything's an improvement over the Hurdal.{\r}
