Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把螺丝钉递给我 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.09,1:06:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这？现在？开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here? Now? Just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.55,1:06:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你这几十年都没有过性生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's been decades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.76,1:06:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是你以为的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty grossed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当… 当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta… Da.{\r}
