Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.76,1:34:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.14,1:34:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要四五个瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four or five moments, that's all it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.10,1:34:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一名英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.56,1:34:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都以为英雄是项全职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone thinks it's a full-time job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.44,1:35:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来就是英雄 刷牙时也是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up a hero, brush your teeth a hero, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.77,1:35:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上班时还是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to work a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.40,1:35:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一生中只有四五个瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over a lifetime, there are only four or five moments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.61,1:35:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真正重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that really matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.20,1:35:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你做选择的瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moments when you're offered a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.74,1:35:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出牺牲 战胜缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make a sacrifice, conquer a flaw, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.46,1:35:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}save a friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.54,1:35:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}spare an enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.75,1:35:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In these moments…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.92,1:35:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余一切都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything else falls away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.43,1:35:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人如何看待我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way the world sees us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.43,1:35:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.64,1:35:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么开枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.94,1:35:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太啰嗦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were droning on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.98,1:35:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我可能会一直 顶着这张发糕一样的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I may be stuck looking like pepperoni flatbread…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.11,1:35:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但起码这混蛋是活不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least fuckface won't heal from that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.15,1:35:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果作为超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}If wearing superhero tights…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.24,1:35:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等于放过危险的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}means sparing psychopaths…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.74,1:35:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许我并不应该成为超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe I wasn't meant to wear 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.95,1:35:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是每个人都跟你一样 高尚得跟个圣父似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone monitors a hall like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.50,1:35:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 行 接下来四个瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I'll be on the lookout{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会注意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the next four moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.46,1:36:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.13,1:36:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我是个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm just a boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.84,1:36:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要站在一个女孩面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}about to stand in front of a girl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.13,1:36:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.51,1:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈要告诉她什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck am I gonna tell her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.59,1:36:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你最好自己想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hmm, you better figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.35,1:36:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至没办法告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.68,1:36:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该 还是该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserved that. That, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.52,1:36:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 裆还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, maybe not the nethers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.19,1:36:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start talking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.15,1:36:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.98,1:36:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.28,1:36:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都对不起 对不起我离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything, I'm sorry for leaving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.32,1:36:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我没有早点出来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for not cowboying up sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.45,1:36:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几年很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been rough couple of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.20,1:36:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艰难？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.05,1:36:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在贩毒的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in a crackhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.13,1:36:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一家12口人同住\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a family of 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.22,1:36:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚我们都要挤着取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night we spoon for warmth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.80,1:36:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都争着要靠着诺埃尔 她是最胖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody fights for Noelle. She's the fattest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.89,1:36:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都是共享的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing that we don't share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.56,1:37:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,空间 牙线 甚至安全套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floor space, dental floss, even condoms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.86,1:37:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你还能住在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you live in a house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.87,1:37:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该早点来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have come and found you sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.25,1:37:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 宝贝 面具下的这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, baby, the guy under this mask, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.71,1:37:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不是你记忆中的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ain't the same one that you remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.59,1:37:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这副面具？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean this mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.95,1:37:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这副\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.03,1:37:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止那副掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case the other fell off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.79,1:38:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Yeah, just… Ow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.13,1:38:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和急救绷带差不多 就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a Band-Aid, just give it a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.88,1:38:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owdie 5, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.05,1:38:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.05,1:38:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.14,1:38:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.48,1:38:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.90,1:38:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.95,1:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.49,1:38:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过短暂的适应期\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a brief adjustment period…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.83,1:38:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再喝一大堆酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a bunch of drinks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.17,1:38:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张脸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a face…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.59,1:38:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很愿意坐上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to sit on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.68,1:39:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套战服下的我 也不是以前的那个我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the same underneath this suit, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.19,1:39:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.77,1:39:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老二超级大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super-penis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.77,1:39:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 韦德 注意用语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Wade. Language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.86,1:39:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有小孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young one is present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.36,1:39:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还在这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you still doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.28,1:39:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边去 去找点事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Go make yourself useful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.03,1:39:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 用你这大块头去帮帮谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, go be a really big brother to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.87,1:39:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让野兽别在我的草坪上拉屎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Beast to stop shitting on my lawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.66,1:39:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 小鸡仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, chicken noodle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.62,1:39:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人可以取代你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing compares to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.50,1:39:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,西尼德奥康娜1990年唱的歌 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinéad O'Connor, 1990. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.63,1:39:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. You're cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.21,1:39:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啥玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.01,1:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在骂我啊 我真为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not mean. I'm proud of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.47,1:39:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你打造成一个X战警的 韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make an X-Man of you yet, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.68,1:39:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.01,1:39:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们就像三个迷你机器狮\N{\fnArial\fs30}it felt like we were three mini-lion robots…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.85,1:39:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一起组合成了一个超级机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming together to form one super robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.89,1:39:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好蠢的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.19,1:39:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.69,1:39:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我一直在等这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, for the moment I've all been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.83,1:40:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.84,1:40:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,威猛乐队 我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wham! As promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.85,1:40:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.06,1:40:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不需要成为超级英雄才追到妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be a superhero to get the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.69,1:40:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的人会让你变成超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right girl will bring out the hero in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.07,1:40:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 结局我们要拉个广角镜头 镜头往后拉出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's finish this epic wide shot. Pull out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.61,1:40:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 继续 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go, that looks nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.24,1:40:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是今晚唯一一个会「拉出」的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna be about the only thing that's pulling out tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.78,1:40:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆满结局 谁不喜欢呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't love a happy ending, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.08,1:40:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次见\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Til next time, this is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.62,1:40:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由这位可怜又友好的邻居 为大家演唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}your friendly neighborhood pool guy singin'…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.96,1:40:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我终将不再跳舞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm never gonna dance again ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.29,1:40:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无法像你我从前那样跳舞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The way I danced with you ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.24,1:41:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不能与你重温舞步 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The way without you ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.29,1:41:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今晚的音乐看似过于喧嚣 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Tonight the music seems so loud ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.30,1:41:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但愿我们能避开人群 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I wish that we could lose this crowd ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.59,1:41:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也许这样会比较好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Maybe it's better this way ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.59,1:41:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们可以用真心话来伤害彼此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'd hurt each other with the things we want to say ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.76,1:41:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们本该是令人羡慕的一对 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We could have been so good together ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.89,1:41:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们本该让这曲共舞永无终结 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We could have lived this dance forever ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.94,1:41:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但现在也没人原意与我共舞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But now who's gonna dance with me ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.90,1:41:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 留下来好吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Please stay ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.78,1:41:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我再也不跳舞了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm never gonna dance again ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.45,1:41:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 充满罪恶的双脚抓不住节奏 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Guilty feet have got no rhythm ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.07,1:41:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然伪装很容易 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Though it's easy to pretend ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.79,1:41:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我知道你也并非傻瓜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I know you're not a fool ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.16,1:41:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 早知不该欺骗朋友 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I should have known better than to cheat a friend ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.17,1:41:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也浪费了被赐予的大好机会 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And waste a chance that I'd been given ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.80,1:41:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以我不再跳舞了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So I'm never gonna dance again ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.42,1:42:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不能再如往日一般与你共舞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The way I danced with you ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.23,1:42:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今 你已离我而去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Now that you're gone ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.36,1:42:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我犯下的错真的如此深重吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I did so wrong So wrong ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.74,1:42:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 令你离我而去 只留下我孤身一人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ that you had to leave me alone ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.32,1:42:31.83,Title,0,0,0,0,,《死侍》
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.67,1:47:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.92,1:47:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. Go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.68,1:47:19.18,Title,0,0,0,0,,你们在等着《死侍2》的预告片啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're expecting a teaser for Deadpool 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.26,1:47:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们可没那个钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't have that kind of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.01,1:47:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还想看什么？以为能看到萨缪尔杰克逊呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you expecting? Sam Jackson to show up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.10,1:47:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带着个眼罩 穿着件拉风的皮衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an eye patch and a saucy little leather number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.81,1:47:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.74,1:47:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我能告诉你们一件事 是个小秘密哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can tell you one thing, and it's a bit of a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.36,1:47:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一部里会有电索\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sequel, we're gonna have Cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.53,1:47:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这角色了不起 有条机械左臂 还能时空旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing character. Bionic arm, time travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.04,1:47:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道谁来演\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea who we're gonna cast yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it could be anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.37,1:47:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是个平头的大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need a big guy with a flat top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.96,1:47:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是梅尔吉布森 道夫龙格尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be Mel Gibson, Dolph Lundgren…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.71,1:47:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯拉奈特莉 她戏路广着呢 谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keira Knightley. She's got range. Who knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.21,1:47:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 大秘密哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, big secret. Shh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.71,1:47:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把垃圾留在这 弄得到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and don't leave your garbage all lying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.72,1:47:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种行为完全不能忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a total dick move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.14,1:48:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
